    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1cc9f530da@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Disposable cannula features</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dri-Lok cannulas come in threaded, non-threaded and distal threaded options, which helps to accommodate a wide range of shoulder, hip and knee procedures.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Stryker cannulas feature a &quot;no-leak triple-seal&quot; design, adjustable inflow/outflow valves, shatter-resistant plastic constructions and color-coding sizes to improve usability.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Available in 5.0mm, 6.5mm and 8.0mm</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Nov 13 2019 20:30:35 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  },
